  {
   "text": "Every morning Emma walks her dog through wet slush.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.007
  },
  {
   "text": "In cotton socks, her toes were cold and damp in minutes.",
   "start": 3.207,
   "end": 6.47
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix: wear wool socks.",
   "start": 6.77,
   "end": 8.515
  },
  {
   "text": "Wool keeps much of its warmth even when damp.",
   "start": 8.715,
   "end": 11.01
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next cold walk.",
   "start": 11.41,
   "end": 13.445
  }
